<td id="A2.T5.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Information budget (Def. <a href="#S2.Thmtheorem2" title="Definition 2.2 (Information budget and certificate). ‣ 2 Preliminaries and Notation ‣ Selective Risk Certification for LLM Outputs via Information-Lift Statistics:PAC-Bayes, Robustness, and Skeleton Design" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.2</span></a>)</td></tr>
